    "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "# SELECT YOUR SDXL / ILLUSTRIOUS MODEL HERE\n# THEN CLICK GENERATE\n\nPick a checkpoint in both loaders once (MODEL_1 = main model, MODEL_2 = refiner; the same model in both works). Random seed every run."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 2,
   "type": "MarkdownNote",
   "pos": [
    560,
    -260
   ],
   "size": [
    900,
    200
   ],
   "flags": {},
   "order": 1,
   "mode": 0,
   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "**MAIN** = the world (scene, background, colours).  **P1** / **P2** = the two characters.\n\n**ACTION** = what they do (count, framing, who is LEFT / RIGHT, pose): the characters receive MAIN + ACTION, the background MAIN only.\n\nSaya keeps MAIN native in cross-attention and adds each character inside its region as a *locked delta* (gain 0.78, in the pack's engine). With `ownership = dynamic` each pixel's owner is read from the model's own attention (anchors = the distinctive tags of P1 / P2).\n\nNeeds: custom nodes **Saya_Couple** (2.0: no ComfyUI core modification), **MultiMaskCouple**, **RES4LYF**. No model is included: choose any SDXL / Illustrious checkpoint in the two loaders."
   ]
  },
